          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ratings of a hotel/eatery:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The experience of eating at a restaurant is influenced not only by the taste or quality of the food but also by the ambience and the service provided. Every customer is asked to rate each of these aspects. The customer’s combined rating"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.702,
            0.238,
            0.841,
            0.256
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "MEAN HOTEL"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.674,
            0.271,
            0.874,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Food ★★★★★ Service Ambience"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.342,
            0.882,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "is determined by the relative weights assigned to food, service, and ambience. Suppose one of the customers has given a rating as shown in the picture. Suppose the weights assigned to food, service, and ambience are 4 : 3 : 2 respectively. The user’s rating"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.423,
            0.684,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "for the restaurant is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{5 \\times 4 + 3 \\times 3 + 4 \\times 2}{4 \\pm 3 \\pm 2} = 4.11"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.467,
            0.883,
            0.585
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ratings of a product:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A store makes and sells portable furniture. The store owners make changes to their products regularly. To calculate the store’s average rating, it makes sense for them to give their current products more weight than older products. For example, they may choose to assign twice the weightage to customer reviews in the last 3 months compared to older reviews."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.597,
            0.853,
            0.658
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We use weighted mean whenever we want the combined result to reflect how much each part contributes to the whole — by amount, time, or importance — rather than just counting each part equally."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.365,
            0.694,
            0.631,
            0.722
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Exercise Set 10.3"
